      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 1 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Tropical Storm RAMIL\nIssued at: 11:00 PM, 18 October 2025(Saturday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: Possible FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Bataan, Tarlac and Zambales within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Laguna, Rizal, Metro Manila, Batangas, Cavite, Bulacan, Nueva Ecija(Gapan, General Tinio, Gabaldon, Laur, Bongabon, Cabiao, San Isidro) and Pampanga(Candaba, Masantol, Apalit, San Simon, San Luis, Macabebe, Arayat) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 AM tomorrow.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
